  "body": "## Goal\n\nAdd circular pattern mode to pattern folders for indexed rotary copies around `A` or `B`, plus planar `Z` rotation around an XY center point for 3-axis machines. Depends on the CL toolpath transforms, pattern folder, and pattern verification sub-issues of `#2938`.\n\n## Scope\n\n- **Circular mode (`crates/app/src/schema.rs`, commands, MCP, project file):** Add `Circular { axis, count, angle_step_deg }` to `PatternDef`, where `axis` is `RotaryA`, `RotaryB`, or `PlanarZ { center }`.\n- **Rotary indexed copies (`RotaryA` / `RotaryB`):**\n  - Transform each enabled copy `k` using `cl::transform::rotate_about_axis` at `k * angle_step_deg` about the WCS origin.\n  - Insert safe retract before each rotary index change.\n  - Validate rotary axis presence and travel limits in `crates/app/src/machine/judge.rs` (`pose_problems`).\n  - Run `crates/app/src/posting_index_swing.rs` and `crates/app/src/posting_swing_standing.rs` for every indexed angle and block the post if clearance fails.\n  - Keep column `stock_sim` refusal for posed moves visible as the not-judged line (`crates/app/src/stock_sim.rs`, `POSED_REFUSAL`).\n- **Planar XY circular copies (`PlanarZ`):**\n  - Transform each enabled copy `k` using `cl::transform::transform_xy` at `k * angle_step_deg` around `center`.\n  - Run full stock simulation, stock bounds, fixture collision, and machine travel checks on all enabled copies.\n\n## Done means\n\nTests post an indexed 4-sided A-axis circular pattern on a 4-axis machine with safe retract before each index, refuse indexing by name when rotary travel or `index_swing` clearance fails, and post and simulate a planar XY circular pattern on a 3-axis mill.\n\nPart of #2938\n",
